## State machine diagram

```
                ┌──────────┐
                │   idle   │ ←── route enter
                └────┬─────┘
                     │
              data fetch starts
                     ▼
                ┌──────────┐
                │ loading  │
                └─┬──────┬─┘
       data!     │      │  empty
            ┌────┘      └───┐
            ▼               ▼
       ┌────────┐      ┌────────┐
       │ success│      │ empty  │
       └────────┘      └────────┘

       (error and not_found surfaces reached from any state)
```

URL state reflected: <list>.

Each state has a render branch in source; `verify-page-state-machine.mjs` cross-checks.

## Focus orchestration on transitions

| from_state | to_state | focus_target |
|---|---|---|
| `idle` | `success` | first interactive element in `<main>` |
| any | `error` | `#error-message` |
| `loading` | `success` | first interactive element in newly-loaded content |

Tests assert each transition's focus target.

