## Composition edge cases

> Interactions BETWEEN composites/atomics on this page; NOT composite-internal or atomic-internal.

| case | handling |
|---|---|
| Deep-link to non-default tab | URL state hydrates state machine; focus moves to first interactive in tab |
| JS disabled | Surface renders SSR-prerendered fallback; interactive elements degrade gracefully |
| Auth lost mid-session | State machine transitions to error; modal asks re-authentication |
| Reduced viewport mid-session | Layout reflows per responsive_matrix; sticky elements unstick if no longer relevant |

